  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#Climb4cancer In few days, Nelly Attar will be attempting the world&apos;s second highest mountain K2, &quot;The Savage Mountain&quot; (8,611m above sea level). Nelly&apos;s climb is dedicated to all the little fighters climbing the mountain of cancer at the Children&apos;s Cancer Center of Lebanon (CCCL). Join Nelly on her 45 day climb, as she takes every brave and tenacious young fighter with her to the world&apos;s second highest mountain - by donating, spreading the word, and/or supporting the children at the center.</narrative>
  </description>
